    "summary": "Once per turn, as a **Normal move**, **Advance move** or **[Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** by this unit ends in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), you may use this ability:\n\n1. Pick an enemy unit this unit can see, no more than 6\" away.\n2. Roll a D6 per **ATALAN JACKALS** model this unit contains.\n3. Each 4+ inflicts 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on the picked unit, up to 6 mortal wounds in total.",
